OL,3,AFootball fan tried to stop train
OL,4,Aattack, jury hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football fan who tried to stop the
OL,7,Fman accused of trying to kill 10 people
OL,8,Fon a train said the attacker was "on a
OL,9,Fmission", a court heard.
OL,11,FStephen Crean said he attempted to stop
OL,12,FAnthony Williams from using a knife on
OL,13,Fa train, which had to make an
OL,14,Funscheduled stop in Huntingdon,
OL,15,FCambridgeshire, on 1 November last
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,18,FCambridge Crown Court heard Crean
OL,19,Fdescribe his grapple with Williams as
OL,20,F"like Come Dancing, we were all over
OL,21,Fthe place", before he called 999 from a
OL,22,Flocked toilet.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
